Flea vendors two ES module bundles under ui/vendor/, built from pinned npm
packages. The bundle files are generated output; the sources of record are the
pinned packages plus the entry files in tools/vendor-js/.

1. MathJax 4.1.3 (https://github.com/mathjax/mathjax), Apache-2.0.
   Packages: @mathjax/src 4.1.3, @mathjax/mathjax-tex-font 4.1.3.
   Licence text: ui/vendor/LICENSES/Apache-2.0-mathjax.txt.
   Used for: texToSvg(source, display) in ui/vendor/math.mjs.

2. beautiful-mermaid 1.1.3 (https://www.npmjs.com/package/beautiful-mermaid),
   MIT. Licence text: ui/vendor/LICENSES/MIT-beautiful-mermaid.txt.
   Used for: mermaidToSvg(source, bg, fg) in ui/vendor/mermaid.mjs.

3. elkjs 0.11.1 (https://github.com/kieler/elkjs), EPL-2.0.
   elkjs is a dependency of beautiful-mermaid and is bundled into
   ui/vendor/mermaid.mjs. Its upstream source is https://github.com/kieler/elkjs
   (EPL-2.0 section 3: the source of a distributed binary must be named).
   Licence text: ui/vendor/LICENSES/EPL-2.0-elkjs.txt.

4. entities 7.0.1 (https://github.com/fb55/entities), BSD-2-Clause.
   entities is a dependency of beautiful-mermaid and is bundled into
   ui/vendor/mermaid.mjs.
   Licence text: ui/vendor/LICENSES/BSD-2-Clause-entities.txt.

Build tool esbuild 0.28.2 is a dev-only build dependency and is not shipped.
